; Values are declarative state. Preserving the complete definition also protects anonymous-class
; methods or other executable syntax nested inside an initializer. A given is likewise a declared
; value; extension containers remain unpreserved so their named def members can be compressed.

(val_definition) @preserve
(var_definition) @preserve
(val_declaration) @preserve
(var_declaration) @preserve
(given_definition) @preserve
